<title>MALAYSIA: Kumpulan Fima year net up 16 pct.</title>
<headline>Kumpulan Fima year net up 16 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>		     (In million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  40.77	 vs	    35.10</p>
<p>    Group shr    (cents)    15.0	  vs	    14.0</p>
<p>    Turnover		   337.04	 vs	   275.43</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    67.39	 vs	    62.60</p>
<p>    Minorities	less     1.73	 vs   less    4.63</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries less     5.26	 vs   less    6.93</p>
<p>NOTE - Kumpulan Fima Bhd is involved in property development, stockbroking, plantations and food business.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
